// A done or error auto job past 48 drops on its own cap.
// A digit job keeps its own cap. A queued job stays.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE cap ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot PROTON 1

PLUG cap law

IMPULSE cap 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "cap" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
